{"suttaId":"tha-ap460","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1233,1259],"vripara":"49"},"segments":{"tha-ap460:0.3":"Jātipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap460:1.1":"“Parinibbute bhagavati, padumuttare mahāyase;","tha-ap460:1.3":"Pupphavaṭaṃsake katvā [pupphacaṅkoṭake gahetvā (syā.)], sarīramabhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap460:2.1":"“Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, nimmānaṃ agamāsahaṃ;","tha-ap460:2.3":"Devalokagato santo, puññakammaṃ sarāmahaṃ.","tha-ap460:3.1":"“Ambarā pupphavasso me, sabbakālaṃ pavassati;","tha-ap460:3.3":"Saṃsarāmi manusse ce [ve (syā.)], rājā homi mahāyaso.","tha-ap460:4.1":"“Tahiṃ kusumavasso me, abhivassati sabbadā;","tha-ap460:4.3":"Tasseva [kāyesu (syā.), kāyeva (pī.)] pupphapūjāya, vāhasā sabbadassino.","tha-ap460:5.1":"“Ayaṃ pacchimako mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap460:5.3":"Ajjāpi pupphavasso me, abhivassati sabbadā.","tha-ap460:6.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap460:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dehapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap460:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap460:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap460:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap460:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā jātipupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap460:11.1":"Jātipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
